{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e17d69738e7c6f9e4910946d86f91b7d65dc67a05df604125b2132319c0cdb16", "ja": "（新年初ライブは、満員御礼！\n一年の始まりに相応しいステージになったな）", "zh": "（新年的第一场演唱会座无虚席！\n真是场配得上一年之始的表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "11b6717bcff862af34490d5fc401207978cd6747adca9f1679d5e5ebb79f0a6f", "ja": "よお、{$P$}。\nどうしたんだ？　もうアンコールも終わったってのに。", "zh": "嗨，{$P$}。\n你怎么了？安可都已经结束了耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "90c08c9479a0adf40f5e7e25cd8db093af8f3da766cf89f18f66a15405039cd4", "ja": "ジュリア、お疲れさま。そういうジュリアこそ、\n着替えもしないで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "茱莉亚，辛苦了。\n倒是你怎么还没换衣服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d1d968f2f13672b6a16d1bf32ffc32579b5322bdbde3d7a85115be3a381f420d", "ja": "あたしは、なんだか落ち着かなくてさ。このまま\n今日を終わらせるのが、もったいないっていうか……。", "zh": "不知道为什么，我有点静不下心来。\n该说是让今天就这么结束，总觉得有点可惜吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "a76019f20a29e0791ad39edde553dabc347799128df5dcdb44862c9d6fcf7a05", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}。\nウチらの新年ライブ、最高に盛り上がってたよな？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n我们的新年演唱会，气氛非常热烈对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "48bf7a9b7d80a83356cb1981a47cba5d8317195dec70e3c2cc17c4c378554feb", "ja": "初詣と同じくらい……いや、それ以上に\n大勢が見ててくれたと思うんだけどさ。", "zh": "感觉跟年初参拜差不多……\n不，来看我们的观众比参拜的人还要多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1006_p", "source_sha256": "021ae7d764e22f6f32dcd9ea592c6f6257478695e1445e65d3401e7b8c7b0ed6", "ja": "ああ、盛り上がりなら負けてなかったよ。\n新しい年に、最高のスタートが切れたな！", "zh": "嗯，就盛况来说一点也不输年初参拜喔。\n为新的一年拉开最棒的序幕了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "04c13412bd4b8c135149b5c26576b628441541d9c5d0a01935d67066c95bd029", "ja": "新しい年か……。そういえば、けっこう経ったのかな。\nあたしが、あんたにスカウトされてから。", "zh": "新的一年啊……说到这个，自从你发掘我以来，\n已经过了好一段时间呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "157cb0609b9148a6727b6672299768f996d6a3e3be783f04512651e8b76162eb", "ja": "こんなふうにアイドルをやることになるなんて、\nちょっと前まで、想像もしてなかったけど……。", "zh": "直到不久前，\n我都不曾想过自己会像这样做起偶像的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "7437d5f13b6f25ea3ccb36cc39b4141d3429b4715988941498e8945a7b09bb20", "ja": "でも、今日みたいなステージがあるとさ。\nストリートもアイドルも、同じだって思うんだ。", "zh": "不过在经历过今天这样的表演后，\n我觉得街头表演跟偶像其实是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "87013136f21e0009d41b3fc590ad10506161dd8561f2e9f6b38d16c9d7d79c3b", "ja": "そうなのか。\nたとえば、どういうところが？", "zh": "是这样吗？\n比方说哪些地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "0c529a5cf1cb6819c508a66b6124e4ff1c8b60def6e41b1eb4b25042e028f956", "ja": "そりゃ当然、お客さんの反応だよ！　ストリートと\nステージとじゃ、目の高さは違うけど……。", "zh": "当然是观众的反应啊！\n虽然街头表演跟站在舞台上的视角不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "b189856c45c0e60dc6850129f468e019d7ad9eaa2a2992b0c524d1da97b6be95", "ja": "でも、あたしが歌って、反応が返ってくる。\nその熱量は、どっちも同じだって感じるよ。", "zh": "不过，我演唱给观众听，然后观众回馈反应给我……\n这一来一往之间产生的热量，我觉得两者都一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "062d21c8a8603ff0df454b5bcac80605cc5a232749e11045947616d27fb09afd", "ja": "いや……ひょっとしたら、アイドルのステージのほうが\n熱いくらいかもしれないな。", "zh": "不对……相较之下，\n人们在偶像表演时说不定更加热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c54e95d457176bf687948fb4f3394ab51a3073f26777b6d9df5c33b6396946fe", "ja": "そうだな。そこにはお客さんの、アイドルに対する\n憧れみたいなものが、混ざってるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊，在那份热情中，\n说不定还参杂了着观众对偶像的憧憬呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "3546ce72c4eff667ffe7a9871aa626cd603ea2fec4c3e4d67a12e826bde11a04", "ja": "憧れか……。なぁ、{$P$}。\nあたしはちゃんと、アイドルやれてるかな？", "zh": "憧憬吗……欸，{$P$}。\n你觉得我算是个合格的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "54fd5e57f11d2d24e38c901f3b4270bf3fbb84f016f6342bfcdc759983900fdd", "ja": "そんなふうに、みんなに憧れてもらえるだけの\nアイドルにさ。", "zh": "就是那种能够让观众\n感受到憧憬的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_1017", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_2000_p", "source_sha256": "37b270099ce5f6d97930291189925d1c0e660273a89be735b8610a88e90f8a9a", "ja": "もちろん。ジュリアはそんなふうに、いつでも\nお客さんに対して、真剣でひたむきなアイドルだ。", "zh": "当然了。茱莉亚一直都是个\n真诚、热心对待观众的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_2001_p", "source_sha256": "beb012fd47eb5d5d96b4a6188356bb562db7b632522ce66ef7b5abc5251068bd", "ja": "俺が保証するよ！", "zh": "我可以保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_2002_050jul", "source_sha256": "6501eabc61d1cd1b02b7626bb44f09aea96bffb76998cfcf81a7e57eff4e9dbf", "ja": "えっ……あ、そ、そうか。\nあ、ありがとうな、{$P$}……。", "zh": "咦……啊，是、是吗？\n谢、谢啦，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0104_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "10740c458a26c8cf433d4905a0b72e7a361ab47ff5ff480f5262d745a51e86e3", "ja": "な、なんか……自分で聞いておいてなんだけど、\n照れるな、こういうの……くぅ。", "zh": "明、明明是我自己开口问的……\n但总觉得好令人难为情……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
